Chapter: ArithNegMod
  cites Codex chapter Numbers
  cites Codex chapter Text

 Exercise int-mod across sign combinations to probe parity and
 correctness on negative operands.

Section: Driver

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    print-line-uni "-- int-mod --"
    print-line-uni ("mod pp: " & integer-to-text (int-mod 7 3))
    print-line-uni ("mod np: " & integer-to-text (int-mod (-7) 3))
    print-line-uni ("mod pn: " & integer-to-text (int-mod 7 (-3)))
    print-line-uni ("mod nn: " & integer-to-text (int-mod (-7) (-3)))
    print-line-uni ("mod zero-numerator: " & integer-to-text (int-mod 0 5))
    print-line-uni ("mod exact-multiple-pos: " & integer-to-text (int-mod 6 3))
    print-line-uni ("mod exact-multiple-neg: " & integer-to-text (int-mod (-6) 3))
    print-line-uni "-- integer / integer --"
    print-line-uni ("div pp: " & integer-to-text (7 / 3))
    print-line-uni ("div np: " & integer-to-text ((-7) / 3))
    print-line-uni ("div pn: " & integer-to-text (7 / (-3)))
    print-line-uni ("div nn: " & integer-to-text ((-7) / (-3)))
  end
